= Magnus Hirschfeld

Magnus Hirschfeld is the founder of the Institut für Sexualwissenschaft and an advocate for the rights of sexual minorities.


- @homosexual_rights_
- @womens_rights_
- @science_funding
- @root: Return to main


@homosexual_rights_
title: Homosexual rights
subtitle: Enact policy that supports homosexual rights.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and labour_in_government and progressive_coalition >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not labour_in_government : The labour is not currently in government. ?][? if progressive_coalition < 50 : We do not have the votes to enact these policies. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; homosexual_rights_timer -= 11; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: homosexual_rights


@womens_rights_
title: Women's rights
subtitle: Enact policy with regards to women's rights.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and labour_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not labour_in_government : The labour is not currently in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; womens_rights_timer -= 10; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: womens_rights

@science_funding
title: Science funding
subtitle: Increase funding for scientific research.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and labour_in_government and economic_minister_party = "labour" and chancellor_party = "labour"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not labour_in_government : The labour is not currently in government. ?][? if economic_minister_party != "labour": This requires the Economic Ministry. ?][? if chancellor_party != "labour": The Chancellor must be an labour member. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: education_science.increase_science


